                <l xml:id="m-6ec42325-d52a-4f52-a4e1-d34b6bb7beb3" facs="#m-1dc0893d-a21f-464a-b4b5-58115c431fd1" label="text-like">nd Sunday or Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-c360e830-85c4-465f-a81c-e4cdb5f7c8a6" facs="#m-8cabbeea-9155-4602-8354-13f2253b26dd" label="ambiguous">330</l><l xml:id="m-56581b82-04a1-472b-9dd2-a46708c3de77" facs="#m-e01c8a0d-5b04-42ee-9a56-b88fcbe096f9" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 11.</l><l xml:id="m-63a3a404-29e9-429a-9955-032347cfddd7" facs="#m-bdc23057-788d-48b2-a40b-92bbaa83da08" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Cum audísset! cere ad turbas de Ioánne: Quid</l><l xml:id="m-f12a2d1d-f649-4525-84c0-cd6452a10cf1" facs="#m-ff5a94fc-1a70-479d-a941-7257dab10f45" label="lyrics-like">A Joánnes in vinculis ópera Christi,</l><l xml:id="m-093dd195-72aa-47e6-84a3-20501a953116" facs="#m-234bd980-1e72-42ca-8166-235304b390b2" label="lyrics-like">exístis in desértum vidére? arúndi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6a48e56c-906f-45ae-9f3f-0d69c124e32e" facs="#m-ffc8794d-8f71-4ba7-a519-88d8c3b419bc" label="lyrics-like">mittens duos de discípulis suis, ait</l><l xml:id="m-634ff446-4e5d-452f-9523-f3d53f05149d" facs="#m-5e35941f-1b67-451b-b622-f3a3b928379d" label="lyrics-like">nem vento agitátam? Sed quid</l><l xml:id="m-7c7934e6-dd00-4707-89c8-b05dcc90e9c8" facs="#m-f53c519c-0acf-4c4c-b2fc-fc2f2aedf776" label="lyrics-like">existis vidére? hóminem móllibus</l><l xml:id="m-4a17ae16-43ea-4c61-bd31-13ad09148457" facs="#m-9bd9bbaa-8c49-470f-b668-9d11e76f8c1a" label="lyrics-like">ili: Tu es, qui ventúrus es, an</l><l xml:id="m-3bed9924-7ce5-453c-9298-9062aff31660" facs="#m-4c33c887-c33f-487c-9ee2-b2525f08ad44" label="lyrics-like">álium exspectámus? Et respóndens</l><l xml:id="m-9122db8b-545b-44bc-95ca-31b57a12fdce" facs="#m-03b0c86f-ee77-472f-9466-1f64a9f7674a" label="lyrics-like">vestítum? Ecce qui móllibus ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ecfe9cb-80e2-4281-9e27-aca652f51aed" facs="#m-f23babf5-ca98-4f28-86ff-aca072567a29" label="lyrics-like">Jesus ait illis: Eúntes renuntiâte</l><l xml:id="m-22db79cd-1a8f-4a49-9abf-d37a9c996e39" facs="#m-b76f27c6-5529-46b7-9cf1-6c1ed659064d" label="lyrics-like">stiúntur, in dómibus regum sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-57c7755c-1a15-4e57-942c-bcdc77e21f78" facs="#m-ee875bf9-a6fe-46ba-a2b0-88c39741080d" label="lyrics-like">Joánni, quae audistis, et vidístis.</l><l xml:id="m-6dd15bbe-d606-4c2c-a0f6-4ecafc55909c" facs="#m-b3507856-3837-4754-94a4-ea66ea93fb26" label="lyrics-like">Sed quid exístis vidére? prophétam?</l><l xml:id="m-0c0c94d6-6a15-42ed-9181-afadcfdf5153" facs="#m-a6d31e98-996c-4a3f-9b20-5859c34b82f4" label="lyrics-like">Caeci vident, claudi ámbulant, le¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb7ebc2e-7fe7-494d-bc82-534122963ab2" facs="#m-60fb9b41-6ed8-4559-b486-5380c2d77748" label="ambiguous">Etiam dico vobis, et plus quam</l><l xml:id="m-e8fcf7c1-1eb8-4b25-a859-d4d7fb373154" facs="#m-93564910-0399-4700-b64c-77e9a766c24d" label="lyrics-like">prósi mundántur, surdi áudiunt,</l><l xml:id="m-7187faa7-3488-411b-96af-1f843cfce82a" facs="#m-bd29ea52-c9eb-4717-ac81-d19fef54d6e8" label="lyrics-like">prophétam. Hic est enim de quo</l><l xml:id="m-6a8032f6-faa8-4319-badc-f47957bd7d76" facs="#m-560eb421-4596-44d0-87ff-9404e8c39436" label="ambiguous">scriptum est: Ecce ego mitto An¬</l><l xml:id="m-851f744d-cd4a-43dc-9e30-a996758829ae" facs="#m-89867fc6-38f6-443d-b3da-49c4852bc111" label="lyrics-like">mórtui resúrgunt, páuperes evan¬</l><l xml:id="m-72cd1e7c-715e-402e-a6de-90f9348ea9cc" facs="#m-41bf6bb7-ee72-4da5-9655-54cf6b51f770" label="lyrics-like">gelum meum ante fáciem tuam, qui</l><l xml:id="m-97ab598d-6a7b-4ea5-8511-98f0590d74cc" facs="#m-556fbd37-5509-4da7-97ff-fdf5c6068d9b" label="lyrics-like">gelizántur : et beátus est, qui non</l><l xml:id="m-d1ab79f7-d603-401a-812d-87f0d96ac0f4" facs="#m-015b36e1-d894-43d2-9038-df6686702fd1" label="lyrics-like">fúerit scandalizátus in me. Illis</l><l xml:id="m-22a6db7a-ade0-4322-981f-a4137dd38798" facs="#m-15409cdb-ca72-4686-9212-b028d000405c" label="lyrics-like">praeparábit viam tuam ante te.</l><l xml:id="m-187deb57-e42d-432c-aa5a-2076914f87d5" facs="#m-b5b36bcc-046b-470a-8913-60e83c306473" label="lyrics-like">autem abeúntibus, coepit Jesus dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-39f605f2-cc8f-4207-ad81-4fb135bd6164" facs="#m-9b6e6625-a046-4217-94b7-c340519dbcf5" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-5e3a8527-fb88-4815-8d7a-59f2303dffcc" facs="#m-4328ac6f-f703-41bc-984f-253ebc3eb86d" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-633e41d7-c609-46fe-a754-aca5a1c5fc97" facs="#m-5af05ef2-1025-4de8-9568-25a96a3cc1ad" label="ambiguous">DE-us" tu</l><l xml:id="m-95f18110-c8e2-40fd-a123-738dcf39887a" facs="#m-a5a6d7df-7b05-4106-970d-db551f97832a" label="lyrics-like">con-vér- tens vi-vi-fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-804071ac-2ccf-433c-9491-a83dd6ed30b1" facs="#m-2918c361-3615-4c5d-a28a-259b46cb6022" label="lyrics-like">cá¬</l><l xml:id="m-9620a713-455f-4775-91ed-44dcb800cd00" facs="#m-8148e459-08dd-4834-89fc-535650838e8f" label="lyrics-like">et plebs tú¬a</l><l xml:id="m-39ac1245-6898-4794-8c75-4d4b678685f0" facs="#m-2cc56a13-4d3b-4f03-979d-0ccedafb63e7" label="ambiguous">bis nos,</l><l xml:id="m-5a92969c-af0c-46ae-b2d8-c42ddca5f9db" facs="#m-893c715c-3c3c-4677-b0c3-bc7e6b4c2a6a" label="ambiguous">lae¬</l><l xml:id="m-22352add-da33-4851-a6b0-f2191247db05" facs="#m-85d279ac-3089-4a00-a3be-3411a7b537f2" label="ambiguous">bis,</l><l xml:id="m-f515b8ff-6e4e-4657-8190-c7bf973b8dda" facs="#m-c3aea8b2-c709-422a-b1a8-2a0ba917b828" label="lyrics-like">Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-839f0ff2-5e0a-4233-b8f3-a57981893808" facs="#m-4d5b57ae-40c5-4e58-bd8d-68501c32d2cb" label="lyrics-like">tá- bi- tur in te: osténde</l><l xml:id="m-d901ac7f-0f9b-45e5-817a-f4de9e8da98d" facs="#m-f687a219-f5b6-445a-9ded-5418a2b16dd8" label="lyrics-like">nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-5593b670-ac28-40db-b617-ab60f98cad31" facs="#m-fb61d14c-946f-4eaa-9c4e-7445fdb9d3c8" label="lyrics-like">mi- ne, mi-se-ricórdi- am tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-51166617-ca94-4cfb-ae69-ee9f965a53a3" facs="#m-67b8ccba-9de4-4dd9-b50f-abc5fb59a42d" label="ambiguous">lu¬</l><l xml:id="m-39f4d97e-52a0-4d1b-bf1b-82aa8d349ccb" facs="#m-cabbb19a-e79c-4dee-a6e2-ee7c18b15ad1" label="ambiguous">et sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-b03de8cd-8a1c-4239-bb5c-5d1da4d637c1" facs="#m-11907261-f373-4b1b-9292-21b108467cbb" label="ambiguous">am,</l><l xml:id="m-fec148b2-eb49-455b-a38f-99f95d50b6f2" facs="#m-f939bee0-2a65-4669-af2e-2a37233a81f7" label="lyrics-like">tá-re tú¬ um da</l><l xml:id="m-099d1e6f-7ad6-464c-bba2-16b19d2a4294" facs="#m-4fef162b-3800-432b-9301-31a1385352a9" label="lyrics-like">nó- bis.</l><l xml:id="m-cbe7814f-8331-48bd-9beb-824c0ec47b8c" facs="#m-37857e12-b21b-41e8-8f34-dadabbc25958" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-0dfaf7fa-b089-4371-b225-2fccbefebfee" facs="#m-b3f1d80d-05f5-44c0-be0b-a10f7c092793" label="lyrics-like">DLacáre, quaésumus Dómine,l frágia meritórum, tuis nobis suc¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf7c44bc-29d7-4be3-871e-5e8e15bd5011" facs="#m-e0819f3d-9437-4557-9ca3-218ebae8b846" label="lyrics-like">humilitátis nostrae précibus, et</l><l xml:id="m-00402ecf-672b-4543-af61-81a905a844c7" facs="#m-ac3e91ef-584a-41e6-8888-6b44b155c4fb" label="lyrics-like">cúrre praesídiis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-bd0788e0-dab1-4cc6-99da-3ad8aee5ea74" facs="#m-1e5e78bc-8884-40ad-907e-3248a1936b59" label="lyrics-like">hóstiis: et ubi nulla súppetunt suf¬</l><l xml:id="m-30abbb92-e2d4-4617-b9de-e68ef04b345b" facs="#m-cd92e9e5-b84f-423c-a568-1c7af3da313e" label="text-like">The other Secrets are as on the previous Sunday, p. 322.</l><l xml:id="m-b624e79c-16d5-4977-af42-77a8b65ad92d" facs="#m-c99e4ccd-284b-4b64-9d8e-98de95241910" label="text-like">Preface of the Blessed Trinity. p. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-e67d7432-9673-4caa-a2d7-97646febc8f6" facs="#m-18908ac3-4847-48c9-98d7-c8a15a0966e7" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-b3779ad6-a034-4c4f-9273-b10adc6e2f54" facs="#m-9df2af10-bb1a-4ac1-b510-cabe4fcd2990" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-df037e00-1791-4298-9d9e-e18c9eb42a44" facs="#m-62f8cb6b-92cf-402f-8e41-dc10834ce298" label="ambiguous">I</l><l xml:id="m-e4ff0959-2b29-4c89-aa33-50d8948c4c0e" facs="#m-4055d5f8-f7a0-470f-b5fd-8951f03c19f5" label="lyrics-like">in excélso:</l><l xml:id="m-eed2be2f-5ac9-4c3a-8d10-7555304541a0" facs="#m-ed8bb22a-bca1-4b3b-84bb-ab82176aa087" label="lyrics-like">E-rú-sa-lem</l><l xml:id="m-3b7775c5-5819-4539-85a4-4b2c70999320" facs="#m-e3a89344-2568-4bbe-b16d-a01c0d8e9c1e" label="lyrics-like">súrge,</l><l xml:id="m-f019bec5-ab5e-46f4-9806-54a8949b2cc8" facs="#m-c5b8f990-2b63-46a8-ad70-2254c204034e" label="ambiguous">et sta</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
